OL,3,AGeorge Michael's 'Faith' guitar up for
OL,4,Aauction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe guitar played by George Michael in
OL,7,Fthe music video for Faith is expected
OL,8,Fto fetch #100,000 at auction.
OL,10,FThe song was the title track of the
OL,11,FHertfordshire pop star's 1987 debut
OL,12,Fsolo album, which sold more than 25
OL,13,Fmillion copies worldwide.
OL,15,FIn the video, the former Wham! frontman
OL,16,Fwore a leather jacket and aviator
OL,17,Fsunglasses while playing the guitar, as
OL,18,Fpart of an attempt to reinvent his
OL,19,Fimage.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,170,160,200,105,0,100
