OL,3,AGeorge Michael's 'Faith' guitar up for
OL,4,Aauction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAuction House, Sworders, is putting the
OL,7,Fguitar under the hammer on 29 October,
OL,8,Falong with other items from the
OL,9,Fcollection of his personal assistant,
OL,10,FSiobhan Bailey, who died in 2014.
